 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2022 年 1 月，Qubit 跨链桥出了事。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 1 月，Qubit 跨链桥出了事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.936,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.698
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "以太坊这一侧，没有收到对应的 ETH。",
   "spoken": "以太坊这一侧，没有收到对应的 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.756,
   "dur": 3.384,
   "speechStart": 5.854,
   "speechEnd": 8.318
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "BNB Chain 那一侧，却铸造出了代表 ETH 的 qXETH。",
   "spoken": "BNB Chain 那一侧，却铸造出了代表 ETH 的 qXETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.36,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 9.458,
   "speechEnd": 13.553
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "公开报道的损失，约 8000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "公开报道的损失，约 8000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.596,
   "dur": 3.48,
   "speechStart": 14.694,
   "speechEnd": 17.229
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "桥相信了一次外部调用的结果。",
   "spoken": "桥相信了一次外部掉用的结果。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 18.296,
   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 18.394,
   "speechEnd": 20.763
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 21.828,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 21.926,
   "speechEnd": 23.08
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "合约用低级 call，去调用一个没有代码的地址。",
   "spoken": "合约用低级 call，去掉用一个没有代码的地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 24.136,
   "dur": 3.768,
   "speechStart": 24.234,
   "speechEnd": 27.067
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "call 返回 true，还是 false？",
   "spoken": "call 返回 true，还是 false？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 28.124,
   "dur": 3.384,
   "speechStart": 28.222,
   "speechEnd": 30.698
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "答案是 true，而且返回数据是空的。",
   "spoken": "答案是 true，而且返回数据是空的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 32.008,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 32.106,
   "speechEnd": 34.784
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "EVM 不会因为目标没有代码，就让 call 失败。",
   "spoken": "EVM 不会因为目标没有代码，就让 call 失败。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-09.mp3",
   "start": 35.828,
   "dur": 3.816,
   "speechStart": 35.926,
   "speechEnd": 38.807
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "如果代码把成功加空返回，当成转账成功，",
   "spoken": "如果代码把成功加空返回，荡成转账成功，",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-10.mp3",
   "start": 39.864,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 39.962,
   "speechEnd": 43.7
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "它就会记下一笔，根本没有发生的转账。",
   "spoken": "它就会记下一笔，根本没有发生的转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-11.mp3",
   "start": 44.764,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 44.862,
   "speechEnd": 47.754
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "记住一句话：每一个外部调用，都是把命运交给别人。",
   "spoken": "记住一句话：每一个外部掉用，都是把命运交给别人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-12.mp3",
   "start": 48.824,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 48.922,
   "speechEnd": 52.91
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-13",
   "text": "对方可能失败，可能撒谎，可能拖延，也可能根本不存在。",
   "spoken": "对方可能失败，可能撒谎，可能拖延，也可能根本不存在。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-13.mp3",
